      "writtenOn": "2025-01-17T09:58:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shouldn\u0027t the parent be the object containing the C++ collection itself? Otherwise it could get GC\u0027d from under us. Or better if we could put it on a symbol of the iterator object so we don\u0027t use `Persistent` which could lead to some objects graphs kept alive forever. ([I have asked about private symbols for napi but conversations derailed](https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/45758))",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 65,
        "startChar": 50,
        "endLine": 65,
        "endChar": 80
      },
      "revId": "1e836096b08fc656b3bf45e15ccd41a91de424e6",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2016c3fe_f228a93a",
        "filename": "src/dawn/node/binding/IteratorHelper.h",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 65,
